@startuml
title Storefront Authentication and Data Exploration Flow

actor User

participant Browser
participant "dWeb\nApache" as DWEB
participant CIDP
participant "Storefront UI" as UI
participant "Storefront Service" as SERVICE
participant "Authorisation\nService" as AUTH
participant "DaaS Catalogue" as CAT
participant "API Proxy" as API
participant "Denodo / Data Service" as DATA

User -> Browser : Open Storefront URL

Browser -> DWEB : HTTPS Request

DWEB -> CIDP : Redirect for Login

CIDP --> User : Login + MFA

User --> CIDP : Credentials

CIDP --> DWEB : ID Token / Access Token

DWEB --> Browser : Session Cookie

Browser -> UI : Load React Application

UI -> SERVICE : Get Services

SERVICE -> AUTH : Validate User

AUTH --> SERVICE : Permissions

SERVICE -> CAT : Fetch Service Index

CAT --> SERVICE : Metadata

SERVICE --> UI : Service Catalogue

User -> UI : Select API

UI -> API : Execute API

API -> DATA : REST Call

DATA --> API : Response

API --> UI : Normalised JSON

UI --> User : Display Data

@enduml
